function drawChart(){if($('chartMetric').value==='indexed'){drawIndexed();return}if($('chartLegend'))$('chartLegend').textContent='实际采样 · '+($('chartMetric').value==='price'?'价格 USD':'流动性 USD');const metric=$('chartMetric').value,all=history.filter(s=>s.pool===selected&&numeric(s[metric])),data=all.slice(-120);$('historyInfo').textContent=storageAvailable?'当前浏览器已记录 '+all.length+' 个有效样本':'浏览器存储不可用 · 仅本次会话记录';if(data.length<2){$('chart').innerHTML='<div class="empty">等待至少两次成功采样<small>仅绘制真实采集点，不补画历史行情</small></div>';return}const w=560,h=205,pad=50,vals=data.map(s=>s[metric]),min=Math.min(...vals),max=Math.max(...vals),range=max-min||Math.max(max*.01,.000000001),t0=data[0].t,td=data.at(-1).t-t0||1,x=t=>pad+(t-t0)/td*(w-pad-10),y=v=>160-(v-min)/range*125;let path='';data.forEach((s,i)=>path+=(i===0||s.t-data[i-1].t>300000?'M':'L')+x(s.t).toFixed(2)+','+y(s[metric]).toFixed(2)+' ');$('chart').innerHTML=`<svg viewBox="0 0 ${w} ${h}" role="img" aria-label="${metric==='price'?'价格':'流动性'}实际采样图"><line x1="${pad}" y1="165" x2="550" y2="165" stroke="#ddd9cf"/><line x1="${pad}" y1="35" x2="550" y2="35" stroke="#e9e6de" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><text x="0" y="38" font-size="10" fill="#918c80">${money(max)}</text><text x="0" y="161" font-size="10" fill="#918c80">${money(min)}</text><path d="${path}" fill="none" stroke="#b9694e" stroke-width="2"/>${data.map(s=>`<circle cx="${x(s.t)}" cy="${y(s[metric])}" r="2" fill="#b9694e"><title>${time(s.t)}：${money(s[metric])}</title></circle>`).join('')}<text x="${pad}" y="194" font-size="10" fill="#918c80">${time(t0).split(' ')[1]||time(t0)}</text><text x="550" y="194" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#918c80">${time(data.at(-1).t).split(' ')[1]||time(data.at(-1).t)}</text></svg>`;}
async function refresh(){if(busy)return;busy=true;$('refresh').disabled=true;try{const res=await fetch(API,{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(15000),cache:'no-store'});if(!res.ok)throw Error('行情接口 HTTP '+res.status);const raw=await res.json();if(!Array.isArray(raw))throw Error('行情数据格式不符合预期');const valid=raw.filter(p=>p.chainId==='robinhood'&&p.baseToken?.address?.toLowerCase()===CA&&typeof p.pairAddress==='string').sort((a,b)=>(num(b.liquidity?.usd)||0)-(num(a.liquidity?.usd)||0));if(!valid.length)throw Error('暂未找到此链与合约对应的交易池');pairs=valid;if(!current())selected=pairs.find(p=>p.pairAddress===PRIMARY)?.pairAddress||pairs[0].pairAddress;const now=Date.now();for(const p of pairs)history.push({t:now,pool:p.pairAddress,price:num(p.priceUsd),liquidity:num(p.liquidity?.usd),volume24h:num(p.volume?.h24),buys24h:num(p.txns?.h24?.buys),sells24h:num(p.txns?.h24?.sells)});history=history.slice(-2000);try{localStorage.setItem('wolfpack-samples-v1',JSON.stringify(history))}catch{storageAvailable=false}lastSuccess=now;failed=false;$('error').hidden=true;render();}catch(err){failed=true;$('error').hidden=false;$('error').textContent=(err.name==='TimeoutError'?'行情接口请求超时':err.message||'行情连接失败')+'。稍后自动重试；已有数据仅供查看，不作为当前判断。';$('verdict').textContent='行情暂不可用，暂停判断';$('verdictText').textContent='请以最近成功获取时间为准。未使用历史报告数字填充。';}finally{busy=false;$('refresh').disabled=false;nextAt=Date.now()+Number($('interval').value)*1000;updateStatus();}}
function updateStatus(){const age=lastSuccess?Date.now()-lastSuccess:Infinity,stale=age>Math.max(Number($('interval').value)*2000,90000);$('status').className='status'+(!failed&&!stale?' ok':'');$('status').textContent=busy?'● 正在获取行情':failed?'● 行情连接异常':!lastSuccess?'● 等待行情':stale?'● 数据已过期':paused?'● 自动刷新已暂停':'● 行情已连接';$('updated').textContent=lastSuccess?'最近获取 '+time(lastSuccess)+' 北京时间':'尚无成功更新';$('refreshHint').textContent=paused?'自动刷新已暂停':'下次刷新 '+Math.max(0,Math.ceil((nextAt-Date.now())/1000))+' 秒';if(failed){$('verdict').textContent='行情暂不可用，暂停判断';$('verdictText').textContent='请以最近成功获取时间为准。未使用历史报告数字填充。'}else if(stale&&lastSuccess){$('verdict').textContent='行情已过期，暂停判断';$('verdictText').textContent='恢复刷新后重新计算当前信号。'}}
